USE	BOOK	multicurrency-many.txt
USE	PRESETS	-
# 多通貨：複数の元金額を合算し、正の支出が2つあっても1回だけ数える。異なるMeasureの組の両替を両方残す
MULTICURRENCY	2026-10-01	2026-11-01
ORDINARY	eur	5000
ORDINARY	jpy	1000
ORIGINAL	usd	45000
EXCHANGE-EXPENSE	jpy	100
EXCHANGE	x1	2026-10-10	wallet	jpy	-100100	wallet	eur	5000
EXCHANGE-EXTRA	x1	food	jpy	100
EXCHANGE	x2	2026-10-11	bank	jpy	-50000	wallet	usd	3000
ENDMULTICURRENCY
